bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Read Chapter UI" as UI
boundary Router
control ChapterController
control ChapterService
entity ChapterModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open chapter detail
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /chapter/{id}
activate Router

Router -> ChapterController: 3. getChapterById(id)
activate ChapterController

ChapterController -> ChapterService: 4. getChapterById(ObjectId)
activate ChapterService

ChapterService -> ChapterModel: 5. Get chapter
activate ChapterModel
ChapterModel -> MongoDB: 6. Query chapter
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ChapterModel: 7. Return chapter
deactivate MongoDB
ChapterModel --> ChapterService: 8. Return chapter
deactivate ChapterModel

opt Chapter not found
    ChapterService --> ChapterController: 8.1 null
    ChapterController --> Router: 8.2 404 Not Found
    Router --> UI: 8.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 8.4 Error message
end

ChapterService --> ChapterController: 9. Return chapter
deactivate ChapterService

ChapterController --> Router: 10. Return chapter
deactivate ChapterController
Router --> UI: 11. Return chapter
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. View chapter
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
